    "detailed_description": "The Definitive Horror Escape Game &quot;THE JUSOU&quot;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe &quot;THE JUSOU series&quot;, renowned as the most terrifying horror escape game in the history of smartphones, is now available on Steam!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMany players have abandoned their games due to the sheer terror it instills! The chilling horror, deemed to be beyond belief, is taking over Twitter feeds and live streams!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt's too terrifying to play alone! If you find yourself unable to play it alone, invite your friends, loved ones, or family members to join the scare-fest!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPromising the most horrifying production ever, we guarantee to deliver chills and thrills that will remain etched in your memory.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*This game contains grotesque depictions, such as horrifying scenes and blood, which may induce trauma.<br />\r\n*Please play at your own risk if you experience any unusual phenomena after playing this game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour love for horror games is about to be taken to the next level.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a0\u25a0Prologue\u25a0\u25a0<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI am standing in front of an old house. I passed this certain house everyday on my way home.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTen years ago, a family with a child stayed here for a while. After they moved out though, nobody has since lived there.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMaybe it`s just my imagination, but... I think i saw somebody inside the house recently.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt makes me curious...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSo, as if possessed, I pass the gate and walk to the front of the house.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFear is contagious\u2026",
